# Phishing Email Analysis

## Objective

Learn how to identify phishing emails using technical and behavioral indicators.

## Indicators

- Suspicious sender
- Fake domains
- Malicious links
- Attachments
- Urgent language
- Social engineering

## Analysis Process

1. Verify sender
2. Inspect links
3. Analyze headers
4. Review attachments
5. Identify Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)

## Skills Learned

- Email investigation
- IOC identification
- Social engineering awareness

## Summary

Email analysis is one of the first defensive tasks performed by SOC analysts to prevent credential theft and malware infections.
